---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="王伟权 · 作品集"
  description="王伟权的产品作品集：案例、思考摘录与联系方式。聚焦数据驱动与人机协同的产品交付。"
>
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">产品经理作品集</p>
    <h1>数据与人机协同，支撑从假设到交付。</h1>
    <p class="lede">产品经理，聚焦广告投放与增长场景的数据平台与人机协同工具；案例与思考见作品与思考库。</p>
    <div class="cta-row">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/work">查看作品</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/library">浏览思考库</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/profile/202605-第三版-王伟权-产品经理.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">查看简历</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="panel panel-start">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top: 0">从这里开始</h2>
    <ul class="start-list">
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/">
          <span class="start-list__title">首页</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">你能得到什么</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/work">
          <span class="start-list__title">案例叙事</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">看我如何解决问题</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/library">
          <span class="start-list__title">思考库</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">我持续这样思考</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/about">
          <span class="start-list__title">关于我</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">所以我是这样的人</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <a class="start-list__item" href="/contact">
          <span class="start-list__title">低摩擦联系</span>
          <span class="start-list__desc">让我们开始一次微型协作</span>
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
